{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/6d7af15ad53b3dc2a564194c6af86818611f5e202ea712369f90d885bc714e364da08b66b1440ca1ed68fc96cbb5f7fc8be8040df133e820cb10ffa29f5034d7","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UA4cn84QGMesPZb6pWYU2ny8NhqYA-2m6yKn4D1PEDtNfvIc2SQA11JTWRGU-0R21DVoDKh6REdSHLgTdfcn5xr4a9zWRy5HbRk1WA","width":600},"name":"Material Design","title":null},"document_id":4588762523500544,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<h2>让设计更懂你：I/O 2022 上的无障碍设计</h2>\n<p>在今年的 I/O 大会上，Material Design 将重点关注无障碍设计。我们的技术讲座、新指南和开发者学习路径旨在介绍并拓展 Material 进行无障碍产品设计的方法。</p>\n<p>去年的 I/O 上，我们发布了 <a href=\"https://material.io/blog/announcing-material-you\">Material You</a>，这是我们设计语言的一次演进，将个人偏好和自适应能力置于核心位置。今年，我们很高兴地展示，动态颜色系统只是 Material 帮助你围绕个人需求进行设计和构建的起点。</p>\n<p>在为 Material You 研究和构建无障碍基础的过程中，设计团队对残障研究中的这句智慧之语深有共鸣：“我试图将残障人士，在他们自己主张的身体之中，定位为意义的创造者&mdash;而不是映照他人意义的表面。”（Jay Timothy Dolmage，Disability Rhetoric）</p>\n<h2>I/O 2022 上发布的内容</h2>\n<p>来看看我们汇总的本周发布内容，帮助你着手打造美观、个性化且无障碍的体验。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>新指南</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://m3.material.io/foundations/accessible-design/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">无障碍基础</a>，包括新的模式和原则</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/switch/accessibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">重新设计的开关组件</a>，包括颜色对比度和无障碍规范</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://m3.material.io/foundations/accessible-design/design-to-implementation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">推出从设计到实现（design to implementation）框架</a>，为屏幕阅读器用户和其他辅助技术导航模式优化体验</p>\n<p><strong>技术讲座</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://goo.gle/io22-designing-accessibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">让设计更懂你：为个人设计无障碍体验</a></p>\n<p><em>本讲座探讨 Material Design 的最新功能如何帮助设计师和开发者打造人人可用的精美产品。我们将分享为组件更新提供依据的新研究，并逐步讲解 Material You 如何默认生成具备必要对比度比率的配色方案！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://io.google/2022/program/33ca1afa-36ba-4f50-b016-0e5c3a3bf063/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google 的无障碍设计框架</a></p>\n<p>借助 Google 用于记录结构、流程与元素的框架，掌握从设计到工程交接的最佳实践，这些结构、流程与元素对定义无障碍体验至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>Codelabs</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://goo.gle/m3-compose-a11y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">用 Jetpack Compose 构建无障碍应用</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://goo.gle/designing-accessible-colors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">使用无障碍颜色进行设计</a></p>\n<p>今年 Material.io 上还会有更多内容，敬请期待。我们将继续致力于改进无障碍组件的对比度体验和关键功能。</p>\n<p></p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2022","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/dfdde015838c6edd850a540e17dfb6806c6f5f042a42bcf89f0b472552a0d75c4fa07804d95cb9ac148bc54a746a3475a9f4ea72a32bccf3f6080d6fbba54b1a","height":1000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/SCaGnZhwF0QmGUAIV2zF-wTopCttEhLKTGeeRTutRb5UN3uPfFZ15y0PB03PmeMXyTXMFBOqtqChZn_CWApL6Qyh-M029PbbsC16c2GP6F5UnQII2AM","width":1600}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":null,"meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":null,"share_image":{},"share_title":null},"published_date":"2022-05-11T08:00:05","slug":"m3-a11y","subtitle":"Material Design 在 I/O 上重点展示最新的无障碍、颜色和组件成果","title":"为每一个人设计","up_next":{"items":[{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/aa46fb2e9fc0d74bf6980c4ce34c10074c4b5645da5e558dd6f77806c6004bbfbaf9ce64a92579920461ccfcf40fb695ee2e8e70f5d123f8d51b88368de3b63a","height":1000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4TKHUGcAK7QwxmDQoB9U8VW8Vga41h1euhZNYaETnDWt5ddo-P_-gLO2YJ3vcSxRuIeM0Er5YrPqdCVmN6HFJ_gcJwYyGA8SgZtehqxqZlyeMiL4hQ","width":1600},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/material-google-io22","label":"Material Design at I/O ‘22","open_new_window":false},"section":"Material Blog","title":"Material Design at I/O ‘22"},"document_id":6513977752027136,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/0dbf8f3115cbfa5a178e5185588c55ef43c5f502e3fe9c63fe606c8c0174d4196b737be22a294ad2b88f38cc39af6ef5b70775ced6ed35dbdc4bb5143d1b09c0","height":1000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/E__E54KcNQqWgTMYwQv_CwLVZTuPGHiGvYBWG9ce8nv2N2SvV3tkKBljJrlT-nUJxR4IBzuLTBcWA3283DIXvLMG_x_fonpXftJwHapQGedWXSy1yXQ","width":1600},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/readability-research","label":"Adjusting Grade for Mode","open_new_window":false},"section":"Material blog","title":"Readability Research"},"document_id":6448980552318976,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/7020836e335f8d40760df71d092d5bd5f244eaf61766f2fe300e4b7d0c0319d8c7864be56c88d2386552675ea0d580d4570954e529e236565601063978629408","height":616,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/yXkkZBCAfbdufNoHIYc5l0AZdQIe72WVopmhlkIkIkMHxIaBD4qK2vR_tUbaiU_wxMPNvYHsSTBApY18HGNkHGqQiIdh_bnLqSe058sv8aJZlA4raH8","width":1064},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/inclusive-imagery-at-google","label":"Adjusting the Focus","open_new_window":false},"section":"Material Blog","title":"Adjusting the Focus"},"document_id":4787852633964544,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}]},"document_id":"6034538337402880"}